{"completed": true, "response": "{\"valid\":true,\"why\":\"H1已经建立了“说不清指向何处的期待”；到S02，B1出现了明确而具体的亲近、默契与温存，B2又有被温柔托住、暂时不必靠岸的舒适感，因此可以推导为：原先无对象的盼望在这种亲近体验里第一次获得了可感的指向，并由此产生温柔的满足。这里不仅宣布“满足”，也给出了原因链条：模糊期待→遇到具体亲近→期待获得方向→满足。没有额外编造人物前史或事件。\",\"coverage_gaps\":[\"S02-B1：肌肤般潮湿、温热、略黏稠的贴近质感未解释\",\"S02-B2：舒适漂浮之下水仍不停、时间仍在流的暗中推进感未解释\",\"S02-B4：因太喜欢当下而在尚未失去时就鼻酸、舍不得、希望时间变慢的预先惆怅未解释\",\"S02-B5：情感短暂上涌、随后回落，并且心事没有彻底说死的段内变化未解释\"]}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0efc5435-29cf-4c29-8e48-735bd0e308b9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045459836702Z", "elapsed_seconds": 10.641, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:55:10.486793+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "79e41b520ffa2cf4030ddcaa656065e96b8ed70913ff120983ab9323933eae39", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be